## Context

This project was scaffolded from [janus]({{janus_repo_url}}) {{template_version}}. The canonical stack choices inherited from janus are recorded below. Any deviation from these defaults requires a new ADR superseding the relevant section.

## Decision

Inherited from janus {{template_version}}:

- Language: TypeScript (strict)
- Runtime: Node {{node_version}}
- Package manager: pnpm
- Lint + format: Biome v2
- Tests: Vitest
- Cloud: Azure ({{region}})
- IaC: Bicep + AVM composition
- Default branch: main (environments enforce deploy approval)
- Agent context: AGENTS.md primary + CLAUDE.md pointer
- Secrets: four-layer model (Key Vault runtime / GH env secrets CI / .env.local dev / GH Packages NPM)
- Azure naming: `{type}-{workload}-{env}` with storage `st{workload}{env}`

